    {
      "handle": "samdykstramilb.bsky.social",
      "author": "Sam Dykstra",
      "team": "全国",
      "outlet": "MLB Pipeline",
      "text": "Happy Thanksgiving to you and yours. Hope a full plate led to a full stomach led to a full heart at your table. Today was the 90th running of the Manchester Road Race. My mom, by her estimation, has done 53 of them. A big number! To get to 53, she first did this race when women weren’t allowed.",
      "likes": 19,
      "reposts": 0,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-11-26T22:53:57.768Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:bdxjovzqrf4q66ptu3dplmeb/app.bsky.feed.post/3n3arctimmk2c",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "感謝祭おめでとうございます。食卓が満ち足りた料理から満腹へ、そして心の充足へとつながっていますように。今日は第90回マンチェスター・ロード・レースでした。母は自分の計算で53回出場。すごい数です！ 初出場は、女性が参加できなかった時代でした。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "nightengalejr.bsky.social",
      "author": "Bobby Nightengale",
      "team": "ツインズ",
      "outlet": "Star Tribune",
      "text": "Catching up on Twins news from last week: Cole Sands agreed to a one-year, $1.19M deal to avoid arbitration and Tommy Nance signed a one-year, $925K contract. The Twins’ remaining arb-eligible players are Joe Ryan, Dean Kremer, Taj Bradley and Kody Clemens.",
      "likes": 12,
      "reposts": 0,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-27T17:43:52.755Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:gtt6sqfv2lck4wxdxymmhrxk/app.bsky.feed.post/3n3cqhbt7rk27",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "先週のツインズのニュースをまとめて。コール・サンズが年俸調停を避けて1年119万ドルで合意、トミー・ナンスは1年92万5000ドルで契約。調停権を持つ残りの選手は、ジョー・ライアン、ディーン・クレーマー、タジ・ブラッドリー、コーディ・クレメンス。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "nightengalejr.bsky.social",
      "author": "Bobby Nightengale",
      "team": "ツインズ",
      "outlet": "Star Tribune",
      "text": "After signing Sonny Gray, the Twins were open about their goal of adding a reliever and a hitter for the right side of their infield. Kevin Ginkel boosts the bullpen. Now, they’re onto adding a bat.",
      "likes": 11,
      "reposts": 0,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-11-26T15:44:35.965Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:gtt6sqfv2lck4wxdxymmhrxk/app.bsky.feed.post/3n37zd34k2s2y",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ソニー・グレイ獲得後、ツインズは救援投手と内野の右サイドを担う打者の補強を目標に掲げていた。ケビン・ギンケルでブルペンは強化された。次は打者の補強へ。"
    }
